From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:15:15 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(geometry): order sheet cuts before material release

Build a global containment forest for placed contours and open chains.
Resolve cut sides and schedule deterministic pass phases.
Refuse cuts after material release and report circular-tool corner limits.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2159
